`verilator_config
// sram_tb.vlt: configuration for tb_sram_<proto> (sim_sram.py --sim verilator).
//
// The backdoor (IP/common/verification/dpi/claude_backdoor.c) reaches the
// GENERIC leaf arrays by name through VPI, so those arrays must be public.
// Only they are: making the whole design public (--public-flat-rw) breaks
// the C++ build of the std::process class in version 5.043.

public_flat_rw -module "sram_macro_generic" -var "mem"
public_flat_rw -module "sram_macro_dp_generic" -var "mem"
